WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
A poor person will never miss a flying arrow

2
00:00:04,660 --> 00:00:06,780
Zhao Kuixing is using us both as cannon fodder.

3
00:00:06,780 --> 00:00:07,940
Go kill Li Hao

4
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:09,940
That only reports to the King of Hell, Yama

5
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:18,580
I also have an eighty-year-old mother named Zhu Meng at home.

6
00:00:18,740 --> 00:00:20,620
You two weak pig heads

7
00:00:21,420 --> 00:00:23,620
I live with your ninth ancestor

8
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:32,760
Who is a certain property?

9
00:00:33,040 --> 00:00:35,360
This is not a trick played in the sky a few days ago

10
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:37,880
Is it a naughty waistcoat who was stripped of his robber's robe by a certain family?

11
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:39,800
You run quite fast.

12
00:00:41,980 --> 00:00:44,500
The general is in trouble and retreat quickly.

13
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:46,780
This monster is simply invulnerable to human power.

14
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:47,980
Bull nose

15
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:50,780
And where is the one in gold armor running?
